+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`. Sales are imported with
+`POST /import/sales` and a JSON body containing `csv` with columns
+`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. Quantities are positive whole portions; soldAt is
+an ISO instant. Previously imported tickets are skipped. The response contains
+`tickets` (distinct tickets) and `dishes` (portions imported). A failed file
+imports nothing and identifies the offending row.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+`{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }` for inclusive UTC days.
+Theoretical use is captured when sales are imported; actual use includes all
+consume movements. Difference is actual minus theoretical.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
